/-!
# M14 source-generated actionable-future portfolio

An actionable exit is not yet a habitable future.  At each generated temporal
visit this module joins the existing tenure and health relation authorities to
two distinct compiler-owned actual-service ordinals.  Every domain component
retains the exact payment, route, non-capture, debit, and root occurrence
already generated by M14.

The public producer accepts only a finite temporal depth.  It accepts no
domain list, slot assignment, matching, capacity, fold image, landing, or
completed schedule.  The two-domain authority is the existing
`EssentialAccessRelationAuthority` test fibre, not a new service registry.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ProcessGame
namespace Society
namespace M14ActionableFuturePortfolio

noncomputable section

open ResponsibilityLifecycle LivingLawEvolution ConstructiveRoot
open Lifecycle Universal Relations Settlement Money UBI Renewal Capacity
